{"id":"0dd13695a736e1f7","group":"89","path":"89/89-ex-glb-normal-form-reduction.md","title":"Ordinal Normal Form Reduction Example","display":"ex-glb-normal-form-reduction — Ordinal Normal Form Reduction Example","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-ex-glb-normal-form-reduction","aliases":["89-ex-glb-normal-form-reduction"],"display":"ex-glb-normal-form-reduction — Ordinal Normal Form Reduction Example","depends_on":["[[89-lem-glb-normal-box-reduction]]","[[89-df-glb-logic]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-ex-glb-normal-form-reduction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-ex-glb-normal-form-reduction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-glb-normal-form-reduction — Ordinal Normal Form Reduction Example"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0413066aa327a245\" href=\"?note=0413066aa327a245\" title=\"89-lem-glb-normal-box-reduction\">89-lem-glb-normal-box-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5a9efa2261b8f73c\" href=\"?note=5a9efa2261b8f73c\" title=\"89-df-glb-logic\">89-df-glb-logic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GLB}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\">\\(\\mathrm{GLB}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5a9efa2261b8f73c\" href=\"?note=5a9efa2261b8f73c\" title=\"89-df-glb-logic\">89-df-glb-logic</a> 的双模态定理集。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha=\\langle2\\rangle\">\\(\\alpha=\\langle2\\rangle\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega^2\">\\(\\omega^2\\)</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta=\\langle1\\rangle\">\\(\\beta=\\langle1\\rangle\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i=3\">\\(i=3\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j=1\">\\(j=1\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=\\neg H_\\alpha\\lor H_\\beta\\lor\\neg C_3\\lor C_1\">\\(B=\\neg H_\\alpha\\lor H_\\beta\\lor\\neg C_3\\lor C_1\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}glb\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form\\text{-}reduction}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;(3,\\alpha,\\beta,3,1)\\in\\mathcal C_B,\\qquad\n\\beta^{+1}=\\langle1,1\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;(\\Box_0B\\leftrightarrow H_{\\langle1,1\\rangle})\\in\\mathrm{GLB},\\\\\n&amp;(\\Box_1B\\leftrightarrow\n(\\neg H_{\\langle2\\rangle}\\lor H_{\\langle1\\rangle}\\lor C_2))\\in\\mathrm{GLB}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}glb\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form\\text{-}reduction}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;(3,\\alpha,\\beta,3,1)\\in\\mathcal C_B,\\qquad\n\\beta^{+1}=\\langle1,1\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;(\\Box_0B\\leftrightarrow H_{\\langle1,1\\rangle})\\in\\mathrm{GLB},\\\\\n&amp;(\\Box_1B\\leftrightarrow\n(\\neg H_{\\langle2\\rangle}\\lor H_{\\langle1\\rangle}\\lor C_2))\\in\\mathrm{GLB}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 16 章 pp.216–217 的转换规则（本目录实例）。印刷页 p 对应 PDF 第 p+39 页。</p>\n<p>侧条件逐项成立：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega^2&gt;\\omega\">\\(\\omega^2&gt;\\omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"3&gt;1&gt;0\">\\(3&gt;1&gt;0\\)</span>，两个末指数分别为 2、1，均至少为 1。第一盒增加序数项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>；第二盒把正迭代指数从 1 增到 2，不能交换两种输出。</p>\n<p>这是依原书转换表实例化的新算例；原书没有逐字列出这一输入。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-lem-glb-normal-box-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"0413066aa327a245","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-glb-normal-box-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-glb-logic","status":"resolved","id":"5a9efa2261b8f73c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-glb-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-glb-logic","status":"resolved","id":"5a9efa2261b8f73c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GLB}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}$ 为 [[89-df-glb-logic]] 的双模态定理集。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{GLB}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha=\\langle2\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta=\\langle1\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"i=3","display":false},{"tex":"j=1","display":false},{"tex":"B=\\neg H_\\alpha\\lor H_\\beta\\lor\\neg C_3\\lor C_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}glb\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form\\text{-}reduction}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&(3,\\alpha,\\beta,3,1)\\in\\mathcal C_B,\\qquad\n\\beta^{+1}=\\langle1,1\\rangle,\\\\\n&(\\Box_0B\\leftrightarrow H_{\\langle1,1\\rangle})\\in\\mathrm{GLB},\\\\\n&(\\Box_1B\\leftrightarrow\n(\\neg H_{\\langle2\\rangle}\\lor H_{\\langle1\\rangle}\\lor C_2))\\in\\mathrm{GLB}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega^2>\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"3>1>0","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":1568,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-215","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"正规化：[[89-df-glb-letterless-normal-form]] → [[89-lem-glb-nice-normalization]] → [[89-lem-glb-second-box-boolean]] → [[89-lem-glb-normal-box-reduction]] → [[89-thm-glb-letterless-normal-form]] → [[89-cor-glb-letterless-truth-decision]]。算例：[[89-ex-glb-normal-form-reduction]]。"}],"outgoing":["0413066aa327a245","5a9efa2261b8f73c"]}